    "searchText": "out of resources – large resupply out of detatrine – large resupply firesale_large_intro_hh headhunters careercontract standing pickup: unresolved for 12 variants kicking the crap out of those frontier fighter bastards seriously depleted our supplies and now our stash of detatrine is practically out of stock. \n\nthat’s why you’re going to put together a full fleet to do a detatrine resupply run to [destination]. \n\nnot sure if you’re familiar with it, but the chemical’s what we use to make our batches of sludge. we can’t really afford to let our sales of the stuff dry up right now. not when we need credits so bad.\n\nthe good news is that depots across the system are offering detatrine and rock-bottom prices. hell if i know why they’re doing it, all i know is that everyone with a lick of sense is trying to get their hands on the stuff so be ready for fierce competition. \n\ni’m trustin’ you to get it done,\nstows out of detatrine – medium resupply out of detatrine – small resupply out of resources – medium resupply out of resources – small resupply out of salvage – large resupply out of salvage – medium resupply out of salvage – small resupply ce9aacc4-41da-47bc-a770-0448144eaa2c 034c16ae-6bb4-43f7-b8b5-3b73000878aa 06e7c7a6-6d26-47b2-91f3-0fe9aad9260d 12ee96a3-7b40-4b09-865c-1b72915d513b 48ce510b-e508-4ab7-89b0-2ecc03108560 06d9be53-b687-4b9a-970d-fba5ff2d8060 171732f8-0c86-4e53-a039-3f31e197d062 3cf9e18c-de1d-44d5-b00e-49553412fd97 a1fb9ef3-7973-41e8-9a56-ab8d953303a9 b2add933-8722-49a0-8f06-85657233d2ae ad2726e6-9781-48db-87c9-a84760bcc0da c2503f41-c663-4097-aa95-763109c87f85 standing +2,400 standing -190,500 28,430,750 auec completion tag 6,560,750 auec 730,000 auec standing +400 14,826,500 auec"
